    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual games! Take care of plants and animals, craft and sell them, add some fun elements, and grow your ranch!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Resources - Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the blocks to get food and water for free, drag to give them to animals and plants, and let them grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/fc6040b7a01ee1c440313376b58f382f.poster.avif?t=1744092812\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/fc6040b7a01ee1c440313376b58f382f.webm?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/fc6040b7a01ee1c440313376b58f382f.mp4?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/46930c2197e29fd101716f92570c4b54.poster.avif?t=1744092812\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/46930c2197e29fd101716f92570c4b54.webm?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/46930c2197e29fd101716f92570c4b54.mp4?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Growth - Production</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use crops to feed animals and obtain by-products, which can be directly dragged to the left to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/d2c394765fc17b822959e8f478a83573.poster.avif?t=1744092812\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/d2c394765fc17b822959e8f478a83573.webm?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/d2c394765fc17b822959e8f478a83573.mp4?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sort out - Processing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tools that can help you quickly sort out produce or process animals into meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/796d2a45fa538366ecaebcfd372bcbfe.poster.avif?t=1744092812\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/796d2a45fa538366ecaebcfd372bcbfe.webm?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/796d2a45fa538366ecaebcfd372bcbfe.mp4?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual games! Take care of plants and animals, craft and sell them, add some fun elements, and grow your ranch!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Resources - Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the blocks to get food and water for free, drag to give them to animals and plants, and let them grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/fc6040b7a01ee1c440313376b58f382f.poster.avif?t=1744092812\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/fc6040b7a01ee1c440313376b58f382f.webm?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/fc6040b7a01ee1c440313376b58f382f.mp4?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/46930c2197e29fd101716f92570c4b54.poster.avif?t=1744092812\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/46930c2197e29fd101716f92570c4b54.webm?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/46930c2197e29fd101716f92570c4b54.mp4?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Growth - Production</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use crops to feed animals and obtain by-products, which can be directly dragged to the left to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/d2c394765fc17b822959e8f478a83573.poster.avif?t=1744092812\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/d2c394765fc17b822959e8f478a83573.webm?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/d2c394765fc17b822959e8f478a83573.mp4?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sort out - Processing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tools that can help you quickly sort out produce or process animals into meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/796d2a45fa538366ecaebcfd372bcbfe.poster.avif?t=1744092812\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/796d2a45fa538366ecaebcfd372bcbfe.webm?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483690/extras/796d2a45fa538366ecaebcfd372bcbfe.mp4?t=1744092812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
